OL,3,GNEWSAD-Day veteran fears future world
OL,4,Aconflict
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Britain's last remaining D-Day
OL,7,Fveterans says he fears for his
OL,8,Fgreat-grandchildren's futures and
OL,9,Fcalled on global leaders to show more
OL,10,Ftolerance amid rising tension.
OL,12,FLes Budding, 101, was 18 when he served
OL,13,Fon board Landing Craft Flak 34,
OL,14,Fproviding covering fire for the first
OL,15,Fwave of troops who stormed Sword Beach
OL,16,Fin Normandy, France on 6 June 1944.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
