OL,1,W5j 5Quzj#5w;jp%p05 jj#57+
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAD-Day veteran fears future world
OL,4,Aconflict
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "The world seems to be
OL,7,Fpreparing for war. I am very concerned
OL,8,Fabout the prospect of another major
OL,9,Fconflict. I have grandchildren and
OL,10,Fgreat-grandchildren and I worry about
OL,11,Ftheir future."
OL,13,FBudding, who lives near Sleaford,
OL,14,FLincolnshire, said he was concerned the
OL,15,FUK, along with other nations, "may be
OL,16,Fwalking into another war".
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
